# As 'channel' but with strong wall-normal grading (BumpZ=0.01): midpoint skew exceeds the
# refinement-interface threshold, so the solver's interface diagnostics are active. Guards the
# device KEP/CDS advection paths against falling back to stale host data on such meshes.
GEO_SRC=examples/RayleighBernard/RB.geo
GEO_SED='s/^Nx = .*/Nx = 32;/;s/^Ny = .*/Ny = 16;/;s/^Nz = .*/Nz = 16;/;s/^Lx = .*/Lx = 6.283185307179586;/;s/^Ly = .*/Ly = 6.283185307179586;/;s/^BumpZ = .*/BumpZ = 0.01;/'
